    fix(guard): set guards.hook_timeout=1020 above test_timeout — BT-088
    
    The pre-commit guard hook used the code default hook_timeout (300s) while
    guards.test_timeout is 900s, so every commit in this repo printed:
    
      WARN: hook_timeout=300s <= test_timeout=900s in
      /home/kara/coding-hermes-boardctl: the guard would be cut off mid-run and
      report a fail-open PASS. Raising this run's budget to 1020s ...
    
    i.e. the hook truncated the run mid-suite and could report a fail-open PASS.
    Set hook_timeout: 1020 explicitly (900s test budget + 120s for the
    secrets/build/lint lanes that run before it) so the hook budget is no longer
    derived by the clamp.
    
    Evidence (foreman, on this tree):
    - RED: `gitreins guard --full` with hook_timeout absent (default 300)
      -> prints the hook_timeout WARN above, "Tier 1 Guards: PASS (test mode:
      full, whole tree)", go_tests ✓ (the arm ran, the hook budget did not cover it)
    - GREEN: hook_timeout: 1020 -> same guard run prints NO hook_timeout WARN,
      secrets/go_build/go_lint/go_tests all ✓, exit 0
    - NEGATIVE arm: hook_timeout: 300 restored -> the WARN reappears verbatim with
      "Raising this run's budget to 1020s", proving the new key is the deciding
      surface and not an ignored config line
    
    ch:trace row=BT-088 spec=none test=guards.hook_timeout evidence=guard-full-red-green-negative verdict=pending commit=this
    
    Co-authored-by: Alexis Okuwa <wojonstech@gmail.com>
---
 .gitreins/config.yaml | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/.gitreins/config.yaml b/.gitreins/config.yaml
index 42d1842..bbe4de7 100644
--- a/.gitreins/config.yaml
+++ b/.gitreins/config.yaml
@@ -8,6 +8,11 @@ guards:
   # loadavg ~30; the same guard passed at 180s on a quiet host 09-28/30).
   # Full-mode suite measures 100-205s standalone — 900s gives 4x headroom.
   test_timeout: 900
+  # BT-088: the pre-commit hook budget must exceed test_timeout. At the code
+  # default (300s) the hook cut the guard off mid-suite and reported a
+  # fail-open PASS, warning on every commit in this repo. 1020s = 900s test
+  # budget + 120s for the secrets/build/lint lanes that run before it.
+  hook_timeout: 1020
   go:
     build: true
     lint: true
